[[Legendary Relic]] is a type of [[legendary equipment]] that, once equipped, has the power to take on the properties of any other [[relic]]. It was introduced in [[The Realm of Dreams]] [[release]] of the ''[[Guild Wars 2: Secrets of the Obscure|Guild Wars 2: Secrets of the Obscure]]'' [[Expansion#Expansion cycle|expansion cycle]] on February 27th, 2024.

== Lore ==
{{Legendary unlock text|"Mmm... This relic is compact. Extremely versatile as well. Should these find their way into too many hands, I will be looking for a new line of business."—[[Archivist Ikur]]}}

== Mechanics ==
The Legendary Relic differs from other [[legendary equipment]] as it won't automatically include the functionality of newer relics added in future [[expansion]]s. Instead, players will have to unlock each relic before being able to select it as an option in the legendary item.<ref name="free">[https://www.guildwars2.com/en/news/legendary-relics-are-coming-soon/ Legendary Relics Are Coming Soon] — Guild Wars 2 Official Website</ref> The Legendary Relic has no visual effects.

With the exception of the core relics (which are all automatically unlocked for use) and ''[[Secrets of the Obscure]]'' relics (automatically unlocked with the expansion obtained), all other relics have to be obtained through normal means prior to them becoming available through the selection window of the Legendary Relic. Practically, this means any relic which has been unlocked as part of a relic collection will be available to the player, even if it has subsequently been deleted.

=== Unlock requirements ===
Automatically unlocked for use within the legendary relic:
* {{achievement|Relics—Core Set 1}}
* {{achievement|Relics—Core Set 2}}

Automatically unlocked with ''[[Guild Wars 2: Secrets of the Obscure]]'':
* {{achievement|Relics—Secrets of the Obscure Set 1}}
* {{achievement|Relics—Secrets of the Obscure Set 2}}
* {{achievement|Relics—Secrets of the Obscure Set 3}}

Requires credit from the associated relic collection:
* {{achievement|Relics—Janthir Wilds Set 1}}
* {{achievement|Relics—Janthir Wilds Set 2}}
* {{achievement|Relics—Janthir Wilds Set 3}}
* {{achievement|Relics—Visions of Eternity Set 1}}
* {{achievement|Relics—Visions of Eternity Set 2}}
* {{achievement|Relics—Visions of Eternity Set 3}}

{{anomaly|
* Although they also can be acquired from ''[[Guild Wars 2: Janthir Wilds]]'' and used as their {{rarity|Exotic}} variant, some relics such as {{item icon|Relic of the Fractal}} require ''[[Guild Wars 2: Secrets of the Obscure]]'' to be used in the [[Legendary Relic]]. <!-- Likely also affects Relic of the Unseen Invasion and Relic of the Wizard's Tower -->
* [[Relics—Visions of Eternity Set 2]] can be acquired and used as their {{rarity|Exotic}} variants regardless of expansion ownership, but require ''[[Guild Wars 2: Visions of Eternity]]'' to be used in the [[Legendary Relic]].}}

