== Notes ==
* Despite stating in the announcement that it would "''come with all Guild Wars 2: Secrets of the Obscure relic effects unlocked''", the Legendary Relic does not allow the selection of SotO relics without owning the expansion.
** This is in contrast to other legendary equipment, which allows selection of expansion-specific stats without owning the related expansion.

== Trivia ==
* Players who had crafted at least one [[Legendary Rune]] before the release of ''Secrets of the Obscure'''s second update, [[The Realm of Dreams]], received the Legendary Relic for free.<ref name="free" />

